 "assembly_order": [
  "Lid off: battery holder in, wires up through the floor hole, lid on (4 x M2 x 8)",
  "Cap off. Measure the TT motor: shaft centre to can end. Shim = 24.4 - that value + 2.4 mm nominal; drop the shim into the channel",
  "Push the 12T pinion onto the front shaft (double-D), then lower motor + pinion straight down into the channel",
  "Lower the 36T wheel straight down through the front slot in the curb",
  "File a 0.5 mm flat on the 3 mm rod; slide it in from the front through the front post, the wheel (D bore) and the rear post",
  "Hub on the rod (D bore), spinner magnet, sail cross onto the hub key; magnets into the curb and cap, cap on"
